<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">

<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Nature's Music Festival</title>
</head>

<body>

    <center>

        <h1>Welcome to Nature's Music Festival!</h1>

        <h2>Listen to the Sounds of Nature</h2>

        <p>Enjoy the peaceful sounds of birds singing and water flowing through the forest.</p>

        <audio controls loop>
            <source src="nature.mp3" type="audio/mpeg">
            Your browser does not support audio playback.
        </audio>

        <br><br>

        <h2>Explore the Beautiful Forest</h2>

        <p>Watch the amazing wildlife and beautiful scenery of a magical forest.</p>

        <video width="550" height="350" controls poster="forest.png" loop>
            <source src="wildlife.mp4" type="video/mp4">
            Your browser does not support video playback.
        </video>

        <h2>Enjoy the Natural World!</h2>

        <p>We used HTML audio and video tags to create an entertaining multimedia webpage.</p>

    </center>

</body>

</html>
